{"steam_appid":2319790,"steam_name":"Captain Wayne - Vacation Desperation","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2319790/254000150/f9a61a03590f84ce1b7ab98ab3a3418f8544d140/1763640345/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764083563","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257235164/bbe73c37905f6798e3a40bb4e89d5c86a2c41f91/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764083563","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/950493730f07cd4f15f1478e09535bfbab34d80e/ss_950493730f07cd4f15f1478e09535bfbab34d80e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781199423","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/30db5ea1515484339651ff6d1ff0f5d58d95d306/ss_30db5ea1515484339651ff6d1ff0f5d58d95d306.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781199423","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/0f120bd019cbdc0173af96953207f7da0d34079d/ss_0f120bd019cbdc0173af96953207f7da0d34079d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781199423","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/5fdf561324d7654c610dfee98b62eb5ebabe5501/ss_5fdf561324d7654c610dfee98b62eb5ebabe5501.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781199423","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/4d03135153e58c849b8f3a33d3ec5a13b8d682cd/ss_4d03135153e58c849b8f3a33d3ec5a13b8d682cd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781199423"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/59631b70d9ba5ed99d1f851226e5525a.avif?t=1781199423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/59631b70d9ba5ed99d1f851226e5525a.avif?t=1781199423 width=800 height=143 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/9135c6e2061170a62f809855d3470326.poster.avif?t=1781199423\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/9135c6e2061170a62f809855d3470326.webm?t=1781199423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/9135c6e2061170a62f809855d3470326.mp4?t=1781199423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness an <strong>elaborately hand-drawn, action-packed epic</strong> inspired by the <i>FPS greats!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of the many <strong>devastating weapons in Wayne’s arsenal</strong> and achieve <i>maximum destruction!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore</i> dangerous locales through <strong>8 humongous areas</strong> all across Orca Isle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HALF GAME, HALF CARTOON!</strong> Delight in the Captain’s <i>depth-defying tale</i> in CAMPAIGN MODE as you <strong>view tons of animated cutscenes</strong> <i>exploring his adventure.</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>high-octane soundtrack</strong> that emphasizes <strong>AGGRESSION and CHAOS!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for the gold in our <strong>ENDLESS MODE</strong>–<i>how long can you survive</i> the onslaught?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/5ee2e4564714a153774b704591ed2364.avif?t=1781199423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/5ee2e4564714a153774b704591ed2364.avif?t=1781199423 width=800 height=143 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/e8529870a5b4c3f16f4690f4cf2ea256.poster.avif?t=1781199423\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/e8529870a5b4c3f16f4690f4cf2ea256.webm?t=1781199423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/e8529870a5b4c3f16f4690f4cf2ea256.mp4?t=1781199423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i>hot pink-wearing, fish-chomping, cigar-huffing</i> <strong>Captain Wayne</strong> refuses to let anything stand between him and his gory conquest to rob and humiliate every rich asshole around the globe. <br><br>After losing his arm in a terrible encounter with the legendary <strong>Vampire Whale</strong>, Wayne replaced it with his trusty shotgun, <strong>The Captain's Ol' Reliable</strong>, and sailed with it across the seven-and-a-half seas in his vessel, the <strong>S.S. Salty</strong>. <br><br>When an unexpected run-in with a group of evil mercenaries leaves him marooned on <strong>Orca Isle</strong> with his ship stolen, Wayne starts doing what he does best: <strong>annihilating everyone responsible.</strong><br><br><i>Equipped with a double barreled shotgun for an arm,</i> countless explosives, and a bad attitude, you’ll have to go toe-to-toe with <strong>The Killer Whales</strong>, the most ruthless mercenaries in all the seven-and-a-half seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES TO EMBODY THE CAPTAIN? </strong> Let’s find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/398b3bc986207ef060e5b5d2385966ff.avif?t=1781199423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/398b3bc986207ef060e5b5d2385966ff.avif?t=1781199423 width=800 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/ebe46df394016c6d88319b079e143d6d.poster.avif?t=1781199423\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/ebe46df394016c6d88319b079e143d6d.webm?t=1781199423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/ebe46df394016c6d88319b079e143d6d.mp4?t=1781199423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mow down enemies with your <strong>double-barreled arm</strong>, rip enemies apart with devious <strong>chain-gun fingers</strong>, toss a bottle of the <strong>explosive Boom Brew</strong>, unleash the <strong>force of thunder</strong> from your palms, or <strong>PUNCH THEM ‘TIL THEY’RE PASTE!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/5fd72ac4a39b43c61b49f372ce1402c5.avif?t=1781199423\" width=482 height=545 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/b3a698b678fac39f80e79c209f728032.avif?t=1781199423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/b3a698b678fac39f80e79c209f728032.avif?t=1781199423 width=800 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those Killer Whales bastards aren’t gonna slaughter themselves! It’s time to rob the rich to feed the badass.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 2100 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB of VRAM with OpenGL 3.3 (GeForce GTX 630 or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 900 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> One (1) from: Concertina, Hurdy-Gurdy, or Blowhorn<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Her bow 'n stern must sort your cargo and prevent any a tide's turn.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-3570k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB of VRAM with OpenGL 3.3 (GeForce GTX 630 or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 900 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Make sure it can handle our game's OST on 500% volume.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> An be she big enough to harbour yer cap'n in the privacy o' his own quarters!</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Ciaran Games LLC"],"publishers":["Silver Lining Interactive"],"release_date":"25 Nov, 2025"}